---

---

<section id="about" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">
      AGAとは
      <span>ABOUT AGA</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="about-main">
        <p class="about-lead">
          AGA（Androgenetic Alopecia）は、<strong>男性型脱毛症</strong>のことです。
        </p>
        <p>
          日本人男性の約3人に1人がAGAと言われており、20代から始まることもあります。
          額の生え際や頭頂部の髪が徐々に薄くなっていくのが特徴です。
        </p>
        <p>
          AGAは進行性の脱毛症であり、<strong>放置すると徐々に進行</strong>していきます。
          早期に治療を開始することで、より効果的に薄毛の進行を抑えることができます。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mechanism-box">
        <h4 class="mechanism-title">AGAのメカニズム</h4>
        <div class="mechanism-flow">
          <div class="mechanism-step">
            <span class="step-label">テストステロン</span>
            <span class="step-desc">男性ホルモン</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mechanism-arrow">
            <span class="arrow-label">5α還元酵素</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="mechanism-step highlight">
            <span class="step-label">DHT</span>
            <span class="step-desc">ジヒドロテストステロン</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mechanism-arrow">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="mechanism-step danger">
            <span class="step-label">毛髪の軟毛化</span>
            <span class="step-desc">細く短い毛に</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="mechanism-note">
          AGAの原因物質である<strong>DHT（ジヒドロテストステロン）</strong>は、テストステロンが5α還元酵素によって変換されることで生成されます。DHTが毛乳頭細胞に作用すると、毛髪の成長期が短縮され、髪が十分に成長する前に抜け落ちてしまいます。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-features">
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 8v4l3 3"/>
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="feature-title">進行性</h3>
          <p class="feature-text">何もしなければ<br />徐々に進行します</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="feature-title">治療可能</h3>
          <p class="feature-text">医学的な治療で<br />進行を抑制できます</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.93 4.93l2.83 2.83M16.24 16.24l2.83 2.83M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.93 19.07l2.83-2.83M16.24 7.76l2.83-2.83"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="feature-title">早期治療が有効</h3>
          <p class="feature-text">早めの対処で<br />効果が期待できます</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prevention-box">
        <div class="prevention-header">
          <span class="prevention-label">だからこそ</span>
          <h4 class="prevention-title">20代・30代から始めるAGA予防</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="prevention-content">
          <div class="prevention-text-area">
            <p class="prevention-lead">
              DHTの生成を抑えるなら、<br /><strong>髪があるうちに。</strong>
            </p>
            <p class="prevention-text">
              5α還元酵素阻害薬は、薄毛が進行してからの治療だけでなく、<strong>進行前の予防</strong>にも有効。
              「まだ大丈夫」と思っている今こそ、始めるベストタイミングです。
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="prevention-chart">
            <p class="chart-title">年代別AGA発症率</p>
            <div class="chart-bars">
              <div class="chart-bar">
                <div class="bar-wrapper">
                  <div class="bar-fill" style="height: 51px"></div>
                </div>
                <span class="bar-value">約26%</span>
                <span class="bar-label">20代</span>
              </div>
              <div class="chart-bar">
                <div class="bar-wrapper">
                  <div class="bar-fill" style="height: 63px"></div>
                </div>
                <span class="bar-value">約32%</span>
                <span class="bar-label">30代</span>
              </div>
              <div class="chart-bar">
                <div class="bar-wrapper">
                  <div class="bar-fill" style="height: 86px"></div>
                </div>
                <span class="bar-value">約44%</span>
                <span class="bar-label">40代</span>
              </div>
              <div class="chart-bar">
                <div class="bar-wrapper">
                  <div class="bar-fill" style="height: 100px"></div>
                </div>
                <span class="bar-value">約51%</span>
                <span class="bar-label">50代</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="chart-note">※ 日本皮膚科学会ガイドラインより</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="comparison-section">
          <p class="comparison-title">早期治療で毛髪を維持</p>
          <div class="comparison-chart">
            <div class="comparison-y-axis">
              <span>多</span>
              <span>毛髪量</span>
              <span>少</span>
            </div>
            <div class="comparison-graph">
              <div class="graph-line treated">
                <span class="line-label">20代から内服</span>
              </div>
              <div class="graph-line untreated">
                <span class="line-label">未治療</span>
              </div>
              <div class="graph-x-axis">
                <span>20代</span>
                <span>30代</span>
                <span>40代</span>
                <span>50代</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="comparison-note">※ イメージ図です。効果には個人差があります。</p>
        </div>
        <p class="prevention-cta">
          20代・30代で「ちょっと気になる」「家族がAGA」という方、ぜひご相談ください。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    background: var(--color-bg-section);
  }

  .about-content {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-main {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .about-lead {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .about-main p {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .about-main strong {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .mechanism-box {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    padding: 32px;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .mechanism-title {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .mechanism-flow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 24px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .mechanism-step {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    background: var(--color-bg-section);
    border-radius: 12px;
    min-width: 140px;
  }

  .mechanism-step.highlight {
    background: rgba(233, 69, 96, 0.1);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-highlight);
  }

  .mechanism-step.danger {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .step-label {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .step-desc {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .mechanism-arrow {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    width: 40px;
  }

  .arrow-label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    color: var(--color-highlight);
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .mechanism-note {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: 1.8;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .mechanism-note strong {
    color: var(--color-highlight);
  }

  .about-features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .feature {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 32px 20px;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }

  .feature-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .feature-title {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .feature-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .prevention-box {
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding: 0;
    background: var(--gradient-primary);
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .prevention-header {
    padding: 24px 32px;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .prevention-label {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 16px;
    background: var(--color-highlight);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    border-radius: 50px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .prevention-title {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .prevention-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    padding: 32px;
  }

  .prevention-text-area {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .prevention-lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .prevention-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .prevention-text strong {
    color: var(--color-highlight);
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .prevention-chart {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .chart-title {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .chart-bars {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-around;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .chart-bar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .bar-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .bar-fill {
    width: 48px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-highlight) 0%, #ff6b8a 100%);
    border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0;
  }

  .bar-value {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 8px;
    color: var(--color-highlight);
  }

  .bar-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    margin-top: 4px;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .chart-note {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 16px;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .comparison-section {
    padding: 32px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .comparison-title {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .comparison-chart {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    max-width: 400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .comparison-y-axis {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
    padding: 8px 0;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .comparison-graph {
    flex: 1;
    position: relative;
    height: 160px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 8px 16px 28px;
  }

  .graph-line {
    position: absolute;
    left: 16px;
    right: 16px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .graph-line.treated {
    top: 20%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4ade80 0%, #22c55e 100%);
    clip-path: polygon(0 50%, 10% 40%, 30% 45%, 60% 50%, 100% 55%);
    height: 60px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, transparent 45%, #4ade80 45%, #4ade80 55%, transparent 55%);
  }

  .graph-line.untreated {
    top: 20%;
    height: 80px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, transparent 20%, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 20%, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 25%, transparent 25%);
    clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 100%, 100% calc(100% + 5px), 0 5px);
  }

  .graph-line.treated::before,
  .graph-line.untreated::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 3px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .graph-line.treated::before {
    top: 25px;
    background: #4ade80;
    transform: rotate(2deg);
  }

  .graph-line.untreated::before {
    top: 10px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    transform: rotate(25deg);
    transform-origin: left;
  }

  .line-label {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .graph-line.treated .line-label {
    top: 15px;
    color: #4ade80;
  }

  .graph-line.untreated .line-label {
    top: 50px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
  }

  .graph-x-axis {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 8px;
    left: 16px;
    right: 16px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .comparison-note {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 16px;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .prevention-cta {
    padding: 20px 32px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-lead {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .mechanism-box {
      padding: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .mechanism-flow {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .mechanism-step {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 200px;
    }

    .mechanism-arrow {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
    }

    .arrow-label {
      transform: rotate(-90deg);
    }

    .about-features {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .feature {
      padding: 24px 20px;
    }

    .prevention-box {
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .prevention-header {
      padding: 20px 24px;
    }

    .prevention-title {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .prevention-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .prevention-lead {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .chart-bars {
      height: 120px;
    }

    .comparison-section {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .comparison-graph {
      height: 140px;
    }

    .prevention-cta {
      padding: 16px 24px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
  }
</style>
